  "translated_term": "Ntungu y'Ambotoko n'Ingwangwo",
  "translation_rationale": "Ntungu y'Ambotoko (Digital) ni mbi y'akwa bokolo, y'ingwangwo y'akwa bokolo (Humanities) ni mbia y'akwa bokolo y'e nkong-nkong y'akwa bokolo. Ntungu y'Ambotoko n'Ingwangwo ni mbi y'akwa bokolo y'e nkong-nkong y'akwa bokolo y'e nkong-nkong y'akwa bokolo (Digital Humanities) ni mbia y'akwa bokolo y'e nkong-nkong y'akwa bokolo y'e nkong-nkong y'akwa bokolo y'e nkong-nkong y'akwa bokolo (Digital Humanities) y'e nkong-nkong y'akwa bokolo (scholarship)."
}
